-- The About section's content, migrated from lcci.com.pk.
--
-- GENERATED by scripts/generate-page-seed.ts from the JSON that
-- scripts/import-legacy-page.ts produced. Do not edit by hand: re-import
-- the page and regenerate, so the text in this file is always text a
-- machine lifted off the live site rather than text somebody retyped.
--
-- Every body below went through `sanitiseBody` -- the same function the
-- admin's save handler calls -- so these rows are indistinguishable from
-- rows an editor pasted in, which is what `src/components/site/prose.tsx`
-- relies on when it renders them with `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`.
--
-- `UPDATE` and not `INSERT`: migration 0025 already created these rows as
-- empty drafts, and it created them at the slugs the routes derive. This
-- fills them in and publishes them. A row an editor has since written to
-- is left alone -- the guard is `body_en IS NULL`, so this can never
-- overwrite the chamber's own correction with a scrape of the old site.

-- about-history
--   from https://lcci.com.pk/about.php?id=75 (1208 chars)
UPDATE content_pages p
  JOIN content_items ci ON ci.id = p.content_item_id
   SET p.body_en = '<h2>Vision &amp; Mission</h2><h3><strong>Our Vision</strong></h3>

<p>To be the best Chamber in SAARC Countries through growth in business volumes, turnovers, exports and contribution in tax revenues.</p>

<h3><strong>Our Mission</strong></h3>

<p>To be the finest organization to serve the business community and to conduct its practices in best possible professional manner.</p>

<p>To be a bridge between the Business Community and Regulatory Bodiesfor in policy advocacy.</p>

<p>To seek long term relations with members reflecting fairness, honesty and transparency.</p>

<p>To build good repute of the Organization and maintaining high professional and ethical standards.</p>

<p>To conduct Business with integrity and strive to be a top Chamber in the Region.</p>

<h3><strong>Our Values</strong></h3>

<p> </p>

<p><strong>Respect</strong> – Treating all well and work with courtesy and respect, the way you want to be treated.</p>

<p><strong>Empathy</strong> – Listening and understanding the feelings and ideas of others.</p>

<p><strong>Shared Responsibility</strong> – taking ownership and working as a team through collaboration among all stakeholders.</p>

<p><strong>Consistency </strong>– being consistent in mastering and maintaining standards in services and overall the image of the institution.</p>

<p><strong>Innovation</strong> – constant creativity in Research, Development and services for value addition and exceeding expectations of members, stakeholders and employees</p>'
 WHERE ci.content_type = 'page'
   AND ci.slug = 'about-history'
   AND p.body_en IS NULL;

UPDATE content_items
   SET status = 'published', published_at = '2026-10-01 05:00:00.000'
 WHERE content_type = 'page' AND slug = 'about-history'
   AND status = 'draft'
   AND EXISTS (
     SELECT 1 FROM content_pages p
      WHERE p.content_item_id = content_items.id AND p.body_en IS NOT NULL
   );

-- about-leadership
--   from https://lcci.com.pk/about.php?id=5 (1210 chars)
--   1 image(s) on the source page are NOT migrated:
--   <img> is not on the sanitiser's allowlist, because alt text is NOT
