   SET p.body_en = '<h2>Information Department</h2><p>LCCI Information Department is one of the focal departments of Lahore Chamber. It issues press releases of day-to-day activities at Lahore Chamber of Commerce &amp; Industry. It also arranges special supplements on the occasion of important functions.</p>

<p>In order to share the viewpoint of business community in response to any policy matter or important happening, this department organizes press conference which is ensured to be widely covered by print and electronic media.</p>

<p><strong>Lahore Chamber News :</strong></p>

<p>In addition to its primary functions, this Department also publishes Annual Report, Member’s List and a Classified Directory of its members. The main objective of Information Department is to keep its members fully informed about the activities at LCCI through the “Lahore Chamber News” being posted to all the members on monthly basis.</p>

<p>LCCI Information Department has also a Studio/Production House well furnished with latest equipment and technology which prepares DVs of all the events of LCCI and then sends the same to all TV Channels so that they could air it by incorporating the news in the daily news coverage.</p>

